OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in tech firms have fallen
OL,7,Fsharply in Asia following huge losses
OL,8,Fin US stock markets amid fears of an AI
OL,9,Fslowdown
OL,11,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,12,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,13,Fmore than 5.5% by the end of Thursday,
OL,14,Flosing an estimated $2.5tn (#1.9tn) in
OL,15,Fmarket value, according to Dow Jones
OL,16,Fdata
OL,18,FAll eyes are now on Europe to see
OL,19,Fwhether the market sell-off of tech
OL,20,Fshares will charge on, writes our
OL,21,Fbusiness reporter - he also explains
OL,22,Fwhat's been happening in Asia trading
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
