OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor context: Japan, South Korea and
OL,7,FTaiwan make most of the memory chips
OL,8,Fand equipment for US AI data centres,
OL,9,Fwhich became a key issue in the recent
OL,10,Fmidterm elections
OL,12,FDemocrats in races across the US
OL,13,Fcampaigned to slow the growth of both
OL,14,Fthe centres and AI - Gina Hinojosa, who
OL,15,Fwon in Texas, pledged to halt new data
OL,16,Fcentre construction entirely
OL,18,FIn a social media post, US President
OL,19,FDonald Trump says: "The Stock Market
OL,20,Fcrashed today because the Dumocrats had
OL,21,Fa big Tuesday", adding it was "sad to
OL,22,Fsee"
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
